[
{
"id": 7424,
"en": "It's a post inviting batters to duel for cash.\nIs this even legal?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7425,
"en": "Someone wants a pro player's advice. It\ndoesn't go into details, though. Maybe a coaching job?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7426,
"en": "There's a campaign going for a new pitching\nmachine. I could win a spectacular prize!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7427,
"en": "Someone wants leads on baseball-related stories.\nMaybe a reporter from some sports magazine.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7428,
"en": "It's a message to me. Is this handwriting... Kurosaki's?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7429,
"en": "It's a message to me. It's written by...\nYeah, Shirakawa. No doubt about it.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7430,
"en": "I beat Shirakawa, but with Kurosaki involved\ntoo, things could get ugly.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7431,
"en": "Takamine used an emery ball to cheat. He was\nsent by Shirakawa to test me.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7432,
"en": "Michio chose his own dream and refused to pay\nKurosaki's bribe to get into that high school.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7433,
"en": "The 145 kph course was Shirakawa's doing. It\nwas another test for me.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7434,
"en": "Asada, the reporter, believed in my innocence.\nHe was sent in by Kurosaki, too.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7435,
"en": "I finally settled things with Kurosaki. I hope\nhe'll let the past stay in the past.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7436,
"en": "I put an end to the twenty-year quarrel with Shirakawa.\nBet we'll be back to our old friendship in no time.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7437,
"en": "Opponent Wanted!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7438,
"en": "Awesome Batter Sought",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7439,
"en": "Get Our Field Back!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7440,
"en": "My Miracle Pitch",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7441,
"en": "My New Miracle Pitch",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7442,
"en": "My Trump Card",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7443,
"en": "Request to Users",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7444,
"en": "Beware of Beanballs",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7445,
"en": "I Want to be a Pro!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7446,
"en": "Don't Look for Me",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7447,
"en": "Drinking Pal Wanted",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7448,
"en": "Your Sign is Next!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7449,
"en": "A Foul Demonstration",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7450,
"en": "Critical Surgery",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7451,
"en": "Koshien in Spring",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7452,
"en": "To Shinada",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7453,
"en": "\"Opponent Wanted. Anyone welcome! Please accept my challenge.\" Wonder what this is about?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7454,
"en": "\"I am looking for the awesome batter mentioned in Kotetsu's blog.\" Is that me? (No retry.)",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7455,
"en": "\"Batter wanted to beat former pro pitcher.\" Huh, what's this about a field? (No retry.)",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7456,
"en": "\"Someone try to hit my miracle pitch.\" Looks like a little kid wrote this.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7457,
"en": "It's from that miracle pitch kid, Kenta. He's a brat, but his pitching is unreal.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7458,
"en": "This must be from that miracle pitch kid, Kenta. He has to ease up or he'll hurt himself.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7459,
"en": "\"Please don't damage or misuse equipment such as bats.\" What kind of idiot does that?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7460,
"en": "\"The Beanball Bully is loose! He hurt me and others. Watch out!\" What is this?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7461,
"en": "\"I'm going to turn pro no matter what!\" It's written over and over. Some high school kid?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7462,
"en": "This is from Kyuma, that guy who's adamant about turning pro. He said he was off to train, but...",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7463,
"en": "\"Let's share drinks while talking baseball.\" That sounds pretty interesting.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7464,
"en": "\"I'm coming to take your sign. Love, the batting center challenger.\" What's this now?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7465,
"en": "\"I don't know how to cut fouls off pitches.\" It does take a certain kind of technique, I guess.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7466,
"en": "\"I'm too scared to go in for surgery.\" Is this person hurt? I wish I could encourage them.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7467,
"en": "\"Go for it, Kinei High! Koshien is within sight this spring!\" Well, good for them.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7468,
"en": "\"Shinada. I'm looking forward to seeing you.\" It's for me? I wonder who left this. (No retry.)",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7469,
"en": "The guy was all talk. It's that blogger named Kotetsu who has me worried. ",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7470,
"en": "Yukina was such a fox. Who would've thought she was that banker's mistress?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7471,
"en": "Bringing a former pro to a sandlot game is just dirty. Glad that's over with.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7472,
"en": "That kid actually had a miracle pitch. Even pros don't throw a curve that wicked.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7473,
"en": "The kid throws a ridiculous forkball. Even the majors don't have anyone throwing those.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7474,
"en": "A disappearing fastball? That kid throws stuff you only see in cartoons.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7475,
"en": "It takes a certain kind of idiot to abuse a bat. They even fought me over it, the dummies.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7476,
"en": "A pitcher that can only throw beanballs. Now I've seen everything.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7477,
"en": "I showed Kyuma how tough pros can be. But somehow, I don't think the lesson's sunk in.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7478,
"en": "I showed Kyuma how tough pros can be again. He says he'll change course. Here's to hoping.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7479,
"en": "That guy was a nasty drunk. If he doesn't tone down his drinking, he'll ruin his health.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7480,
"en": "Is there any joy in collecting batting center signs? He said he was going away to train.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7481,
"en": "I showed a high school kid how to cut fouls. I hope it helps improve his technique.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7482,
"en": "I gave the kid courage to get surgery. I didn't realize it was for that bit of anatomy, though.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7483,
"en": "Mikasa's arm was okay. I expect him to be a star at the spring nationals in Koshien.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7484,
"en": "It was Ashida, my former batting pitcher. He's a great guy who was always on my side.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
