},
{
"id": 7567,
"en": "Look at the schedule board to see a list of jobs that are currently \navailable. Select a job from this list in order to take it on.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7568,
"en": "There is a wide variety of jobs. There will be more jobs and job \ntypes as the game progresses.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7569,
"en": "Taking on jobs improves Haruka's idol abilities, so try to take on \nas many different jobs as you can.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7570,
"en": "When you complete jobs, the agency will deposit your wages \ninto your account.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7571,
"en": "You can withdraw your wages at a convenience store ATM.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7572,
"en": "Head to a convenience store whenever you need money.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7573,
"en": "Okay, let's check out the schedule.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7574,
"en": "You have two things on the board today.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7575,
"en": "The big event, of course, is the Princess League finals at Soten TV \nin the afternoon.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7576,
"en": "And in the morning, you have a handshake event sponsored by \nthe fan club.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7577,
"en": "Your lessons are important, naturally, but these kinds of \nactivities are vital too, so keep plugging away at them.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7578,
"en": "Okay. Let's head to the handshake event now.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7579,
"en": "Select Handshake Event from the list.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7580,
"en": "Sorry to hurry you, Haruka-chan,\nbut could you head out to that civic event?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7581,
"en": "The Princess League event isn't until this\nafternoon. Let's go to the handshake event\nnow.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7582,
"en": "We don't have much time, Haruka-chan. Let's go the handshake event.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7583,
"en": "Okay, let's go!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl + diálogo uid010d005c"
},
{
"id": 7584,
"en": "You cannot take on jobs right now.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7585,
"en": "There's no time, Haruka-chan. Hurry out to that civic event!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7586,
"en": "Haruka, get on over to the TV station.\nYou don't got time to be doing other jobs.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7587,
"en": "Haruka, you don't have time for anything else.\nGet on over to the TV station.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
