{
"id": 7738,
"en": "Button icons will move down the four lines.\nPress each button just as its icon overlaps with\nthe circle. The more accurate button presses you\nmake in a row, the better your results will be.\n\n\nAt times, you will need to press and hold a\nbutton. Begin holding down the button when its\nfirst icon overlaps with the circle, and release\nthe button when its second icon overlaps.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7739,
"en": "Make %d accurate button presses.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7740,
"en": "As you make accurate button presses, the Score\nGauge will build up.\n\nWhen battling against a rival, a Battle Gauge is\nused in place of the Score Gauge.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7741,
"en": "Gameplay changes during the song's interlude.\nNow's your chance to really show off your moves!\nPress the appropriate <Color:1><Action:Button_DPad_Left@Princess_League><Action:Button_DPad_Right@Princess_League><Action:Button_DPad_Up@Princess_League><Action:Button_DPad_Down@Princess_League><Color:10> button just as the \nblue circle overlaps the red circle.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7742,
"en": "Make %d accurate button press.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7743,
"en": "During play, you can enter <Color:40>Idol Heat Mode<Color:10> by\npressing <Color:1><Action:Button_L1@Princess_League><Color:10>. While <Color:40>Idol Heat Mode<Color:10> lasts, button\npresses will have a greater effect, such as\nfilling the gauge up more quickly.\n\n<Color:39>The number of times you can use Idol Heat Mode\nis limited to the number of heart marks that\nappear at the top left of the screen, so be sure\nto use it wisely.<Color:1>\n",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7744,
"en": "Press <Color:1><Action:Button_L1@Princess_League><Color:10> to enter Idol Heat Mode and make %d accurate button presses.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7745,
"en": "Button icons will move across one of the four bars.\nPress each button just as its icon overlaps with the circle \nat the right-hand end of the bar.\n\nPoints are added to your score with each\naccurate button press.\n\nIn dance battles and dance events, your Performance\nparameter affects how many points you get.\n\nThe one with the most points at the end of the battle wins.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 7746,
"en": "Use <Color:1><Action:Button_DPad_Left@Street_Battle><Action:Button_DPad_Right@Street_Battle><Action:Button_DPad_Up@Street_Battle><Action:Button_DPad_Down@Street_Battle><Color:10> to switch\nbetween the top, bottom, left, and right bars.\n\nIn order for a button press to be counted as correct,\nyou must have the appropriate bar selected beforehand.\n\nSwitching between bars and pressing the buttons accurately \nis the key to success.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
}
